item.description:
trump doesn't want to escalate before the midterms. iran is escalating anyway.
after midterms, that math changes.
@gzeromedia

we need an independent agency that can 1) identify, 2) communicate, and 3) contain ai threats.
we don’t have that process. we don’t even have the beginnings of it.
